Package: ferret
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/SoFluffyOS/ferret
Depends: libgtk-3-0t64 | libgtk-3-0 (>= 3.22), libglib2.0-0t64 | libglib2.0-0, libegl1, libgles2, libstdc++6, libc6 (>= 2.31)
Recommends: wl-clipboard
Suggests: adb, gnome-shell-extension-appindicator
Description: Continue what you were doing on your other devices
 Ferret carries what you are doing between your own devices: the page you
 are reading, media, your clipboard, files, notifications, texts and calls.
 It works on the local network between Android, iOS, macOS, Linux and
 Windows, end-to-end encrypted. No account, no cloud, no telemetry.
 .
 Installs the app as `ferret` and the command line as `ferret-cli`.
